{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-040.md","record_count":17,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s040-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"கேசரிவர்மன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பழிகாரி ஓலை தயாரித்துவிட்டாள், அவள் காரியத்தை வெற்றிகரமாக்க கடைசி ஓலை கொஞ்சம் ஏமாந்தால் அதுவே நமக்கு சாவோலை ஆகிவிடும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"சத்யசீலர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விஷயத்தைச் சொல் வர்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"கே. வ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தனுக்கு முடிசூட்ட முயன்றாள் வஞ்சகி! மன்னர் மறுத்தார். ஆகவே இந்த மாளிகையை வசப்படுத்தி மகனை அரசனாக்க மாற்றான் உக்ரசேனனுக்கு மடல் அனுப்பியிருக்கிறாள்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உக்ரசேனன்! இமயபுரி வேந்தன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"ராஜப்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆம்! நம் சாம்ராஜ்யத்தில் நுழைய சமயம் பார்த்திருப்பவன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"கே. வ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உக்ரசேனனிடமிருந்து பதில் கொண்டு வருபவன் இந்த வழியேதான் வந்தாகவேண்டும். வாருங்கள் பார்ப்போம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யார் நீ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"அட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னையா கேட்கிறாய்? நான் நான்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"வர்ம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எங்கே போய்க்கொண்டிருக்கிறாய்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"அட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போகவேண்டிய இடத்திற்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":64,"printed_page":63}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"ராஜப்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"துரோகம்... விடக்கூடாது இதை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இப்போதே புறப்படுவோம்... அந்த வக்ரபுத்திக்காரியை கூண்டோடு அழிக்கவேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"கே. வ.","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அழித்துவிட்டால் உங்கள் வீரம் வெளிப்படும். அந்த வேசியின் வேஷம் வெளிப்படாது. இளவரசே! அரை நொடியில் சாகடிக்க அல்ல நான் இப்படியெல்லாம் இவ்வளவு காலம் ஏங்கித் திரிவது? என்னாலும் முடியும் எப்போதோ செய்திருப்பேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன் செய்யவில்லை?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"வர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விவேகம் இளவரசே! விவேகம். அப்போது கொன்றிருந்தால் அந்த கள்ளிக்காக கண்ணை இழந்த அரசர் கண்ணீர் வடித்திருப்பார். அவள் சூழ்ச்சிகள் அம்பலமாயிருக்காது. சூதுக்களை உலகம் தெரிந்துகொண்டிருக்கமுடியாது. அவளை சாகடிப்பதில் இல்லை நம் சாமர்த்தியம். அவள் சதிகளை அம்பலப்படுத்துவதில்தான் இருக்கிறது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதற்கு வழி......","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"},{"id":"manohara-s040-d017","scene_id":"manohara-s040","scene_ordinal":40,"transition_audit_id":"T040","speaker_label":"வர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முள்ளை முள் கொண்டு எடுப்பது போல சூழ்ச்சியையால்தான் வெல்லவேண்டும். சொல்லுகிறேன் வாருங்கள்,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":65,"printed_page":64}],"source_scene_file":"scene-040.md"}]}